ited to platform administrators through the Dashboard's existing authentication/authorization mechanism.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-3 (P1): The Dashboard admin view shows current-month consumption against each project's Kueue quota.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41968,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-87585dba9a11245f","agent_id":"abc56259f823db85b","session_id":"ca8c4d42-2d41-4182-b458-e5ffdb2fceb6","uuid":"bba651e8-336e-41f7-a283-8864ccc08480","timestamp":"2026-10-26T21:36:08.511Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9018"}
