{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a3c4ea75c883ac26","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9018-E005\n3\ttitle: Admin view of current-month consumption against Kueue quota\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9018\n5\tcomponent: Dashboard\n6\tteam: RHOAI Dashboard\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\tdependencies:\n10\t- RHAISTRAT-9018-E002\n11\t- RHAISTRAT-9018-E004\n12\tai_signals:\n13\t  change_specificity: 0\n14\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n15\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n16\t  existing_foundation: 1\n17\t  open_questions: -1\n18\t  external_dependency: -1\n19\t  human_process_gates: 0\n20\t  repo_access: 1\n21\t  architecture_claims: 1\n22\timplementation_type: null\n23\tinvestigation_signals: null\n24\tai_implementability: Medium\n25\tai_implementability_score: 2\n26\tjira_key: null\n27\tbranch: null\n28\tgated_by: null\n29\tgate_failure_impact: null\n30\t---\n31\t# Admin view of current-month consumption against Kueue quota\n32\t\n33\t## Description\n34\t\n35\tThis epic delivers the administrator view that shows current-month per-project GPU-hour consumption alongside each project's Kueue quota, so platform administrators can see how much of each project's quota is being consumed this month. It renders the per-project consumption figures computed by the chargeback reporting capability next to quota figures derived from the validated per-project quota attribution contract.\n36\t\n37\t## Scope\n38\t\n39\t- Implement the Dashboard admin view showing, per project, current-month GPU-hour consumption next to that project's Kueue quota.\n40\t- Consume per-project consumption from the metering-data-backed report computation (current-month period).\n41\t- Derive quota figures per the validated per-project quota attribution contract, including its documented semantics and any caveats.\n42\t- Restrict the view to platform administrators via the Dashboard's existing authentication and authorization.\n43\t- No new report computation logic, export, or API surface in this epic — it presents the two existing inputs together.\n44\t\n45\t## Acceptance Criteria\n46\t\n47\t- The Dashboard admin view displays, for each project, current-month GPU-hour consumption alongside that project's Kueue quota.\n48\t- Consumption figures in the view match the per-project report figures for the current-month period.\n49\t- Quota figures in the view are derived per the validated per-project quota attribution contract, using the semantics that contract specifies.\n50\t- The view refreshes its figures from the metering data (no manual data entry).\n51\t- Access to the view is limited to platform administrators through the Dashboard's existing authentication/authorization mechanism.\n52\t\n53\t## HLR Traceability\n54\t\n55\t- HLR-3 (P1): The Dashboard admin view shows current-month consumption against each project's Kueue quota.\n56\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8f0901c2f864f29c","agent_id":"a53ae90e14f3a23a4","session_id":"ca8c4d42-2d41-4182-b458-e5ffdb2fceb6","uuid":"9918d9c5-0699-41d2-a4e1-43e0164dce3f","timestamp":"2026-10-26T21:38:40.779Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a3c4ea75c883ac26","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9018 decomposition"}
